# Code ownership rules are intentionally left unconfigured in the base template so
# fresh clones never fail GitHub owner resolution on placeholder team handles.
#
# After instantiating this template in your user or organization account, optionally
# uncomment and set real GitHub handles/teams, then set `require_code_owner_review: true`
# in `xtask/src/github.rs` if multi-team ownership is desired:
#
# /schema/compatibility.json @your-github-handle
# /.github/ @your-github-handle
# /xtask/ @your-github-handle
